        "title": "Riemannian Geometry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A **Riemannian metric** g on M is a smooth (0,2) tensor field that is:\n- Symmetric: g(X,Y) = g(Y,X)\n- Positive definite: g(X,X) > 0 for X != 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-RIEMANNIAN-GEOMETRY.md#007",
      "path": [
        "04-RIEMANNIAN-GEOMETRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
