        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Riemannian Geometry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  In local coordinates (x^1,...,x^n):\n  g = Sum_{i,j} g_{ij} dx^i tensor dx^j"
    },
    {
